n{aligned}2 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe acute angle between $x$ and $S$ is the acute angle between $x$ and ${\\text{proj}}_{S}x.$  \n\nComputing the cosine using the dot product, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta  & =\\frac{x\\cdot {\\text{proj}}_{S}x}{‖x‖‖{\\text{proj}}_{S}x‖} \\\\  & =\\frac{4\\cdot 2+0\\cdot (-2)+0\\cdot 0}{\\sqrt{{4}^{2}+{0}^{2}+{0}^{2}}\\sqrt{{2}^{2}+(-2)^{2}+{0}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{8}{\\sqrt{16}\\sqrt{8}} \\\\  & =\\frac{8}{4\\cdot 2\\sqrt{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\n\\theta =\\operatorname{arccos}⁡(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2})=\\frac{\\pi }{4},\n$$\n\nwhich is already an acute angle." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186416360 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186416364 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186416360 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "22bcf45c-640c-575f-a16d-c7b5c8b62a7e" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186416360 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186416358 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186416361 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186416363 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186416361 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "6a574829-aeac-59dc-b7f2-f0730e2342d5" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186416361 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186184778 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186416362 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186416361 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186416362 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "a7cb447b-1a24-58bb-a8de-9b45b9c2e4bb" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186416362 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186416359 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186416363 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186416360 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186416363 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "c19427b8-35d1-5ec6-a82b-132f5b304d1b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186416363 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186416357 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186416364 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "e5babb95-1720-532d-87a1-a1a7b17c6c2c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186416364 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186416356 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186488451 #edb/r